  "zh": "# 中国AI算法被质疑用于低俗内容，特斯拉飞车概念引热议，开源模型Krea 3发布\n## AI产品与技术\n- **有人用AI复刻出Adobe全家桶**：开源社区出现Adobe套件AI克隆，引发版权与创工具担忧。\n- **Krea 3 发布**：面向大规模编辑的图像模型，提升设计工作流效率。\n- **Muse Spark Open**：Meta 开放的多模态生成模型，推动开源AI竞争。\n## 行业争议\n- **国内一半AI算力被指在造爽剧**：算力资源被用于低质量短剧，引发监管与伦理讨论。\n- **AI为何会欺骗人类**：探讨模型产生幻觉与误导的根源，提醒用户警惕信息失真。\n- **批量AI小海正收割姨姨妈妈们**：AI驱动的直播带货工具在中老年用户中快速渗透，市场规模扩大。\n## 国际视野\n- **英伟达RTX Spark性能分析**：新一代光线追踪架构在AI推理中的表现受到关注。\n- **AI反向工程硬件**：利用AI逆向芯片设计，显示安全与创新的双刃剑。",
  "en": "# China's AI power accused of feeding low‑brow dramas, Tesla flying car rumors stir buzz, and open‑source Krea 3 model drops\n## AI Products & Tech\n- **AI clones Adobe suite**：Open‑source clone of Adobe Creative Suite raises copyright and tool‑safety concerns.\n- **Krea 3 released**：Image model built for large‑scale editing boosts designer workflow efficiency.\n- **Muse Spark Open**：Meta’s open multimodal generative model fuels open‑source AI competition.\n## Industry Controversy\n- **China AI power low‑brow dramas**：Massive compute diverted to sensational short videos, sparking regulatory and ethical debate.\n- **Why AI deceives humans**：Explores model hallucination and misinformation sources, warning users to verify AI output.\n- **AI Xiao Hai targets shoppers**：AI‑driven live‑selling tool spreads rapidly among older users, expanding market size.\n## Global Outlook\n- **Nvidia RTX Spark performance**：New ray‑tracing architecture shows strong AI inference gains, drawing industry attention.\n- **AI reverse‑engineers hardware**：Using AI to dissect chip designs highlights both security risks and innovation potential."
